Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyIntersectionTraffic" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1, :vehicle2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :fog1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Other vehicle at intersection" .

:vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Ego vehicle entering intersection" .

:fog1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision risk due to low visibility in fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential collision risk due to limited line-of-sight and environmental constraints caused by heavy fog conditions at an intersection.
Severity Score: 0.65